WEBVTT

00:04:28.139 --> 00:04:30.349
They were full American citizens.

00:04:31.267 --> 00:04:35.229
Unions enabled others
to attain the American dream

00:04:35.271 --> 00:04:37.815
by raising wages generally

00:04:37.857 --> 00:04:42.320
and by reducing wage disparities
between men and women

00:04:42.361 --> 00:04:44.488
and among the races.

00:04:48.159 --> 00:04:52.330
My research has shown me

00:04:52.371 --> 00:04:56.959
that with every transformation
in the economy, the technology,

00:04:57.001 --> 00:04:58.586
the way we work,

00:04:58.627 --> 00:05:01.756
there has been an evolution
in the labor movement.